  "owned_service_and_duplex": "Owned Windows service/client lifetimes use atomic job membership and selected process creation/image identity. A single-use controller reserves launch slots and disables dispatch before owned termination; stopped status requires observed primary exit, empty owned jobs, no launch in flight and completed retryable handle cleanup. Authenticated duplex results bind request, route, scope, peer lifetime and fresh receiver generation. Read-only recover_permit returns matching durable current state without replay, refund or authority renewal. The model-free native development inspector calls the existing six kernel routes through one captured kernel/store; identity-only owners and positive effect admission remain closed. Stop also requires observed worker exit; active input-handle writes exclude cleanup.",
  "owner_limits": "This is development execution, IMPLEMENTED_NOT_QUALIFIED. Same-account jobs and image-file hashes do not establish filesystem/network/credential isolation or loaded-code attestation. Native launch and control writes run in retained background workers; their underlying synchronous operations still rely on ordinary OS scheduling. Control/result reads and process/job observation remain synchronous; no universal native/driver deadline is claimed. Stop does not cancel a kernel COMMIT. Lost or denied results may follow committed consumption and require read-only reconciliation, never automatic replay/refund. Drafts are per-view memory only. Offscreen Qt controls and a hidden native Windows render do not qualify visible UI/accessibility. Trusted time/approval/resource/revocation owners, protected effects, installed/offline, independent/human, power-loss, physical/device/custody/hardware/distributed/endurance lanes and all original cases/gates remain open. Source adoption is unchanged; six transition decisions remain unresolved. Historical V18-GAP-002 records46 blank Owners Cockpit CHAPTER ACCEPTANCE RULE bodies (witness635/rawPDF e8484ea4...,139pages/48headings/two populated), distinct from128 AppendixB scenarios; no new PDF/visual/provenance proof is claimed in this job.",
