  "authority_freshness_repair": "Public consumption evidence retains the exact authenticated context and checks durable subject, proposal/read-set/grant scope, event attribution and coherent generation-bearing cells. Preparation, consumption and revocation repeat exact original owner predicates and context checks immediately before and after COMMIT; preparation/consumption also enforce final deadlines. PostCOMMIT denial preserves issued/held, consumed/charged or revoked state. Internal one-argument historical evidence remains compatible. Positive runtime/effect owners remain closed.",
  "next_action": "Continue CMP-07/WP-06 actual request/task compilation, source/correction custody and material clarification with exact ContextEnvelope/template/token/prepared-request contracts; then implement authenticated acceptance and finite kernel grants with their time/approval/resource owners and full lifecycle. Implement durable historical-attempt and unconfirmed-edit recovery, qualify actual native occupancy and the remaining full product lanes. Preserve the full175 requirements/25 components/28 packages/20 volumes/406 lifecycle sections/128 cases/8 gates; finish the product rather than treating closed development gates as completion.",
  "stop_dispatch_repair": "Tracked background client/service launch and request preservation/control send leave Qt and the Stop state lock free of those blocking operations. Separate send ownership, actual thread-exit observation and input-handle write leases prevent second dispatch or cleanup while a writer remains. Stop wins before logical send admission; late failure cannot revive Stop or replace a validated result. Original attempt, envelope, selected lifetime and deadline remain fixed. Unpersisted exact requests remain in memory through STOPPED. Reservation return is not disk/IPC acknowledgement; logical admission is not physical WriteFile ordering; memory retention is not restart durability.",
  "preparation_recovery": "Authenticated kernel.recover_preparation selects a durable issuance from the exact original ActionProposal when its generated permit selector was lost. The original message/context, principal/session, issuance event, exact proposal bytes, coherent issuance/permit/intent generations and full historical input commitment are checked before disclosure. New preparations retain the original grant commitment in exact internal intent v2; existing v1 consumption, permit recovery and peer evidence remain supported without migration. Unknown-selector v1 lookup explicitly denies unavailable input evidence. The query observes real PREPARED or CONSUMED state and calls no writer, clock, positive owner, refund, renewal or effect. The sixth route is integrated into the envelope, application, response codec, RECOVERING allowlist and native picker. The original context is checked again after the final union read. An isolated retained pre-repair candidate fails precisely that injected boundary; the corrected suite passes.",
  "task_drafts": "Typed task.create/save/load/list routes preserve exact original instruction bytes separately from editable title/draft. The injected task owner authenticates the original envelope/context, SID and logical principal; creates CREATED-only snapshots with uninterpreted meaning fields; atomically commits the draft, minimal kernel objective revision, catalog and event to the existing SQLite journal; rejects stale CAS, tombstones, foreign owners and substituted events. Objective generations prevent A-to-B-to-A revision reuse. Exact TASK_ABSENT observes never-present current cells and catalog exclusion without claiming historical rollback. The owned native controller retains uncertain task writes, preserves recovery during unrelated reads, validates current observations for explicit reconciliation and bounds retained history before new dispatch. The native task view keeps late acknowledgments separate from newer edits, offers retained local-draft navigation, explicit remote revision adoption, usable recovery controls, all-cached-draft close consent and editor freeze until observed Stop. The existing kernel inspector remains available through --inspector; no positive production effect authority is added.",
  "task_drafts_limits": "The durable CREATED task/draft lane and manual UNACCEPTED interpretation capture are development mechanics. Exact same-controller committed-create lost-reply reconciliation and fresh-controller/session committed-save content recovery now have controlled native execution evidence, separately pinned in the current development receipt. Historical uncertainty receipts and persistence of unconfirmed local edits remain unfinished; a fresh controller does not import or settle the old uncertain attempt. Power-loss recovery, installed UI/accessibility, cross-SID isolation, original acceptance and full product qualification remain unqualified. Selected-cell and response bounds do not bound full journal verification or native I/O occupancy.",
  "historical_owned_service_and_duplex_before_increment29": "Owned Windows service/client lifetimes use atomic job membership and selected process creation/image identity. A single-use controller reserves launch slots and disables dispatch before owned termination; stopped status requires observed primary exit, empty owned jobs, no launch in flight and completed retryable handle cleanup. Authenticated duplex results bind request, route, scope, peer lifetime and fresh receiver generation. Read-only recover_permit returns matching durable current state without replay, refund or authority renewal. The model-free native development inspector calls the existing five kernel routes through one captured kernel/store; identity-only owners and positive effect admission remain closed. Stop also requires observed worker exit; active input-handle writes exclude cleanup.",
  "historical_task_drafts_limits_before_increment29": "This is a durable CREATED task/draft lane, not full task semantics or original acceptance. Nine new native Windows methods use isolated owned-service fixtures; history capacity includes controlled padding and current-absence recovery includes a deliberately redirected missing pipe. Ten client and thirteen offscreen Qt methods use controlled delivery; Stop/Esc exercises the real controller with an injected held sender. Native committed-write acknowledgment loss, power-loss recovery, installed UI/accessibility, cross-SID isolation, historical uncertainty receipts and persistence of unconfirmed local edits remain unqualified. Selected-cell and response bounds do not bound full journal verification or native I/O occupancy.",
